{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Rect</strong> is a complex idle clicker game with almost infinite possibilities. Destroy rectangles to get different currencies and buy unique upgrades. Increase your power with prestige upgrades, evolve generators and break limits! Defeat bosses and unlock various perks. Complete all in-game goals or dominate the ranked system - choose your pastime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle and clicker gameplay\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five different types of currencies to purchase unique upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige, evolve and limits breaker upgrades which require a progress reset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses with increasing difficulty to get extra rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks upgrades which allow you to boost<strong>\u00a0</strong>stats infinitely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra income features like exchange system, interest and lottery bets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements and global ranking system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite gameplay with possibility to reach and complete the final goals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and stylish graphics with clean and simple interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No in-app purchases and no early access. Just enjoy the completed game!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979210?t=1756985645","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979210?t=1756985645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979210/262b9fdf6722184484f3dd783395f9888c424ac1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756985645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979210/262b9fdf6722184484f3dd783395f9888c424ac1/c